{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10610010","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10610010","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"narration:1:1061001001:0":{"text":"The outskirts of Holistone are as peaceful as ever, until a girl falls from the sky...","source_cn":"圣石镇郊野一如往常的平静，直到一位少女从天而降，打破平静……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0E3593431693B8F1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The outskirts of Holistone are as peaceful as ever, until a girl falls from the sky...","female":"The outskirts of Holistone are as peaceful as ever, until a girl falls from the sky...","variant_male_record_index":"101878","variant_female_record_index":"101879","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1061001002:1":{"text":"Ah!","source_cn":"啊——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52DF6CDD81F8A538","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1061001003:1":{"text":"Owww!","source_cn":"好……痛！可恶……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DE32FD7E08859A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1061001004:0":{"text":"Huh? Where... am I?","source_cn":"嗯……？欸？这是哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A952493462C2CA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1061001005:0":{"text":"No way...\nDon't tell me that gate sent us to different places!","source_cn":"难道说……\\n刚才那扇门把我们传送到了不同的地方？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x978A2EB5064E67B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1061001006:0":{"text":"This is the middle of nowhere! How am I supposed to find my way back alone?!","source_cn":"不会吧，荒郊野岭的，我一个人叫我怎么回去啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D90319AAB924E84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1061001007:1":{"text":"Nooo!!!","source_cn":"不要啊啊啊啊——！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x892F7FAEB7327DB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:10:1061001008:1":{"text":"After a moment, the girl begins to collect herself.","source_cn":"很快，金发少女冷静了下来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B99B7EB7D157BF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1061001009:0":{"text":"Okay... okay. Panicking's not gonna help. First thing's first—gotta check out the area.","source_cn":"总之，先探探路吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62CB0DD4450A4ED1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1061001010:0":{"text":"I was just practicing my Celestial Spirit Magic... The gate opened like usual, but Aquarius never showed.","source_cn":"呼……本来在练习星灵魔法，结果星灵之门虽然打开了，但不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64F9307B138E5329","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1061001011:0":{"text":"Weird... Did my magic mess up? Or did something happen to her?! I definitely sensed her magic earlier. I never should've jumped through that gate...","source_cn":"奇怪……难道是我的星灵魔法有问题吗？还是说……阿葵亚失...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7080C32B806F945","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1061001012:0":{"text":"I can't feel any other Celestial Spirit's magic here. Looks like my other Spirit Keys won't work either...","source_cn":"这里完全感知不到其他星灵的魔力，看样子其他星灵钥匙也没...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5DAC7DF810396C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1061001013:0":{"text":"No, get it together, Lucy! You've fought dragons, dark guilds, and Erza's wrath! You can handle this!","source_cn":"没关系的露西，一起和同伴经历了那么多，你已经变强了！就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91151C9F4C86214C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1061001014:0":{"text":"Time to face this head-on!","source_cn":"很好！就用这股气势前进吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D3CD25CE8AE2365","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:18:1061001015:1":{"text":"Lucy walks ahead on her own for a while...","source_cn":"露西独自往前走了一会……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x379B5FC4DD48E10B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1061001016:0":{"text":"Not even a single signpost... Seriously, where am I?","source_cn":"连个可以问路的人都没看见……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82F68B9901C6FEA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1061001017:0":{"text":"Grug grug ga!","source_cn":"咕咕嘎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E3C73C6B061840F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1061001018:0":{"text":"Uh, hi there! Excuse me—","source_cn":"嗨，你好呀！请问……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4E3CD8DDE9CF376","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1061001019:1":{"text":"Grug ga!","source_cn":"嘎嘎咕！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06DDB140043B01D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1061001020:1":{"text":"Huh? Are you talking to me? Do you speak, like... words?","source_cn":"呃……你是在跟我讲话吗？能用我听得懂的语言吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB810606AE07758D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1061001021:1":{"text":"Grug! Grug ga!","source_cn":"咕嘎！咕嘎嘎！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6F59C5771B077C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1061001022:1":{"text":"Whoa, whoa! Don't suddenly get so close!","source_cn":"喂喂！别突然靠这么近啊！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94D075710EE5B269","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1061001023:1":{"text":"Grug!!","source_cn":"咕嘎！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72A7877FABA235C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1061001024:1":{"text":"You're attacking me! Oh no you don't!","source_cn":"想攻击我？那我就不客气了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5030219C7C5ADA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1061001025:0":{"text":"Open, Gate of the—","source_cn":"打开吧——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x345C0B9B2BC23844","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1061001026:0":{"text":"Wait, I can't summon any spirits right now...","source_cn":"……等等，我现在叫不出任何星灵……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x805748D4802C6D05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1061001027:1":{"text":"Ugh, stay back!","source_cn":"呃，不要过来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x116F081D2F8F66B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1061001028:0":{"text":"Ga?","source_cn":"咕嘎？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0F4638DB5AA674C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1061001029:1":{"text":"In that case...\nTime to run!","source_cn":"既然如此……\\n只能先撤了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8852A23A471F59A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1061001030:1":{"text":"Grug grug ka!!!","source_cn":"咕咕嘎！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7471FA7A6D4D588","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1061001031:1":{"text":"Quit chasing me!","source_cn":"可恶，别追我啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF00B826E9BBDDE15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1061001032:0":{"text":"Natsu, where are you?!","source_cn":"纳兹，你在哪里啊——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2A6F8F48844C1B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1061001033:1":{"text":"Fire Dragon's... ROAR!","source_cn":"火龙的！咆哮！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F919C056586F245","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1061001034:1":{"text":"Grahhh!!","source_cn":"嘎……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EEB1431FED406DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1061001035:0":{"text":"Lucy! Fancy running into you here!","source_cn":"露西，又见面啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F015E35FDC172F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1061001036:0":{"text":"Natsu! It really is you!","source_cn":"纳兹！真的是你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD38FC94A90E3144E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1061001037:0":{"text":"Wait, what are you doing here?","source_cn":"等等……为什么你会在这里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x671B2F9E198E9896","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1061001038:0":{"text":"Oh, I came to ask you if you wanted to take on a job. But then I saw this weird gate where you were... I heard you yelling from inside it, so I dove in!","source_cn":"哦！我是去找你约任务的，结果发现你在的地方有扇奇怪的门...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA78DF50C32AAD41E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1061001039:1":{"text":"And the gate?","source_cn":"那传送门呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD7A3CB1257456A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1061001040:1":{"text":"Gone! I jumped in right before it vanished. Pretty cool, huh?","source_cn":"关闭了！我是趁它消失前最后一刻跳下去的！嘿嘿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x491464470D0BED20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1061001041:1":{"text":"What?! What do we do now... How are we supposed to get back?!","source_cn":"什么！这可怎么办……我们该怎么回去啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A1DBCFACDA1CD32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1061001042:1":{"text":"By the way, Lucy—where are we, exactly?","source_cn":"话说回来，露西你来这里干什么？这是哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEB316C1E6741543","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1061001043:1":{"text":"You tell me! I was trying to summon Aquarius, but she never showed up. Instead, that gate appeared.","source_cn":"我也不清楚这是哪里……我只是想叫出阿葵亚，谁知道她没有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E75819A8D0D7477","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1061001044:0":{"text":"Any idea where to find her, Natsu? Got any leads?","source_cn":"要去哪里找阿葵亚，纳兹，你有头绪吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x540766A717DF8B67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1061001045:0":{"text":"Hah, leads? Nope.","source_cn":"哈，头绪？没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA37CA82936385F2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1061001046:0":{"text":"But if we keep moving forward, we'll figure something out!","source_cn":"但继续前进，总能找到方向吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D0F1C7CC6E73A97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1061001047:0":{"text":"Lucy, let's go!","source_cn":"露西，一起前进吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA90B10ACFFFD365","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1061001048:0":{"text":"...Yeah!","source_cn":"……嗯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C92011ADF590449","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:58:1061001049:1":{"text":"With Natsu by her side, Lucy feels a wave of relief wash over her.","source_cn":"纳兹的出现，让露西分外安心……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD77C9EA1F4E54DA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:59:1061001050:1":{"text":"Together, they walk through the unfamiliar land, until at last, a sign appears: Holistone.","source_cn":"两人并肩穿过陌生的郊野，不知徒步了多久，二人来到了一个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C0814743763FDF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1061001051:0":{"text":"I wonder if they have a guild here... If we can find some mages, it might speed things up.","source_cn":"不知道这里有没有魔导士公会，如果有公会帮忙，那找阿葵亚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C833B5EF365B7BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1061001052:0":{"text":"Only one way to find out!","source_cn":"找个人问一下吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1895AE15044A907","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:65:1061001053:0":{"text":"Hey there, friend! Excuse me!","source_cn":"那边的朋友，你好呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7DCBA9910D0D9E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:66:1061001054:0":{"text":"Do you know where the local Mage Guild is?","source_cn":"请问魔导士公会在哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65EABADFB1811C61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:67:1061001055:0":{"text":"Mage Guild...? What's that?","source_cn":"魔导士？公会？那是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AE04045210D0A56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:68:1061001056:0":{"text":"Huh? You don't have one here?","source_cn":"咦，你们竟然没有吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B840FF444808C53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1061001057:0":{"text":"Mages use magic to fight and help people!","source_cn":"魔导士，就是能够用魔法战斗的人啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A07B912349B3850","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1061001058:0":{"text":"And a guild is like a big family! Like <style=\"stress\">Fairy Tail</style>!","source_cn":"公会，就是一个大家庭！比如<style=stress>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DEB206A06CCCC3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:71:1061001059:0":{"text":"Fairy what now?\nCan't say I've heard of it, but I do know what mages are!","source_cn":"什么妖精的尾巴？听不懂。\\n但我知道什么是魔法师！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2A922DE0B8A148D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:72:1061001060:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>'s the strongest mage we've seen in ages—maybe only second to Magister Merlin!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0E4C1679BA1DF2DD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>'s the strongest mage we've seen in ages—maybe only second to Magister Merlin!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>'s the strongest mage we've seen in ages—maybe only second to Magister Merlin!","variant_male_record_index":"101943","variant_female_record_index":"101944","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:73:1061001061:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>? Never heard that name before... Are we even in Earth Land anymore?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE57A31506C5DF933","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>? Never heard that name before... Are we even in Earth Land anymore?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>? Never heard that name before... Are we even in Earth Land anymore?","variant_male_record_index":"101945","variant_female_record_index":"101946","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:74:1061001062:0":{"text":"Oh, let me tell you! He is an old friend of General Hogan. He stopped a climate disaster once, and he even made it snow in Ryeham during the Winter Carnival! That place never sees snow!","source_cn":"没错，<male>他</male><female>她<...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0140398E7A5C76B7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"Oh, let me tell you! He is an old friend of General Hogan. He stopped a climate disaster once, and he even made it snow in Ryeham during the Winter Carnival! That place never sees snow!","female":"Oh, let me tell you! She is an old friend of General Hogan. She stopped a climate disaster once, and she even made it snow in Ryeham during the Winter Carnival! That place never sees snow!","variant_male_record_index":"101948","variant_female_record_index":"101949","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:75:1061001063:1":{"text":"As the villager rattles off story after story about <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, Lucy and Natsu exchange glances.","source_cn":"两人听村民滔滔不绝地谈论了<style=stress>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDEA761AC670CEE7F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"As the villager rattles off story after story about <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, Lucy and Natsu exchange glances.","female":"As the villager rattles off story after story about <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, Lucy and Natsu exchange glances.","variant_male_record_index":"101950","variant_female_record_index":"101951","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:77:1061001064:0":{"text":"Seems <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> is a total legend. He sounds almost as strong as Gildarts!","source_cn":"听起来，这个<style=stress><player...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x081AFC25E3998489","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"Seems <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> is a total legend. He sounds almost as strong as Gildarts!","female":"Seems <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> is a total legend. She sounds almost as strong as Gildarts!","variant_male_record_index":"101952","variant_female_record_index":"101953","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:78:1061001065:0":{"text":"Yeah, I suppose he can't be a bad person. Maybe we should go ask him for help?","source_cn":"听起来倒不像是什么可疑的人，不如去找<male>他</...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0F1443DCA37CEDC6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"Yeah, I suppose he can't be a bad person. Maybe we should go ask him for help?","female":"Yeah, I suppose she can't be a bad person. Maybe we should go ask her for help?","variant_male_record_index":"101954","variant_female_record_index":"101955","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:79:1061001066:0":{"text":"Yeah! Let's do it!","source_cn":"好啊！就这么办！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FD4B7E74997A050","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:80:1061001067:0":{"text":"But... how do we even find someone like <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>? Wouldn't he find a pair of strangers like us suspicious?","source_cn":"不过话是这么说……我们怎么找到<style=stres...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0DB432DE6F263C55","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"But... how do we even find someone like <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>? Wouldn't he find a pair of strangers like us suspicious?","female":"But... how do we even find someone like <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>? Wouldn't she find a pair of strangers like us suspicious?","variant_male_record_index":"101957","variant_female_record_index":"101958","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:83:1061001068:0":{"text":"Pardon the interruption...","source_cn":"失礼了，请允许我打断你们的对话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADBA41D86E639F86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:84:1061001069:1":{"text":"Hello! Who are you?","source_cn":"你们是？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D1A7BDC7E33B00C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:85:1061001070:1":{"text":"I'm Cassadee, a mage.","source_cn":"我是科丝蒂，一名魔法师。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF82229699C41CDDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:86:1061001071:1":{"text":"And I'm Valen, one of Holistone's knights.","source_cn":"在下是圣石镇的骑士，维伦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD23EE723F8D96845","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:87:1061001072:1":{"text":"Oh! Nice to meet you...?","source_cn":"呃，你们好，有什么事吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x345844FC45132B12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:88:1061001073:0":{"text":"We just overheard you mention <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> earlier.","source_cn":"没什么大事，我们只是听到你们刚才提到了<style=s...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEFD9E59D61DFA60F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We just overheard you mention <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> earlier.","female":"We just overheard you mention <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> earlier.","variant_male_record_index":"101964","variant_female_record_index":"101965","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:89:1061001074:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> isn't a suspicious person at all.","source_cn":"没错，<style=stress><player_na...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE872F7366A546680","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> isn't a suspicious person at all.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> isn't a suspicious person at all.","variant_male_record_index":"101966","variant_female_record_index":"101967","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:90:1061001075:1":{"text":"I used to only read about him, until I saw his magic firsthand. He has done far more than any record could capture.","source_cn":"我曾经只是在书里读到过<male>他</male><f...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3977574092124304","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"I used to only read about him, until I saw his magic firsthand. He has done far more than any record could capture.","female":"I used to only read about her, until I saw her magic firsthand. She has done far more than any record could capture.","variant_male_record_index":"101968","variant_female_record_index":"101969","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:91:1061001076:1":{"text":"The blessing <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> placed on Ryeham still protects its people to this day.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB5EE6361A3FE576B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The blessing <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> placed on Ryeham still protects its people to this day.","female":"The blessing <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> placed on Ryeham still protects its people to this day.","variant_male_record_index":"101970","variant_female_record_index":"101971","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:92:1061001077:1":{"text":"I see... What a wonderful person!","source_cn":"不，你误会了！我们只是刚刚到这里，对这里一无所知而已……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCE45DAFD16D53F82","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I see... What a wonderful person!","female":"I see... What a wonderful person!","variant_male_record_index":"101972","variant_female_record_index":"101973","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:93:1061001078:1":{"text":"Yes! Therefore...","source_cn":"那么，公平起见，我也会向你们道歉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4901C22E1A93A0E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:94:1061001079:0":{"text":"I overheard you mention <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>—not intentionally, but still, I'm sorry...","source_cn":"我刚才听你们提起<style=stress><play...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4D83049196ACCF4B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I overheard you mention <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>—not intentionally, but still, I'm sorry...","female":"I overheard you mention <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>—not intentionally, but still, I'm sorry...","variant_male_record_index":"101975","variant_female_record_index":"101976","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:95:1061001080:0":{"text":"I get how you feel.\nI'd react the same way if someone badmouthed Fairy Tail.","source_cn":"哎呀，能理解你的心情…\\n要是有人说妖精的尾巴奇怪的话...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4509F4DDC63B679","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:96:1061001081:0":{"text":"Fairy Tail...?","source_cn":"妖精的尾巴……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x727C0AFB77681AA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:97:1061001082:0":{"text":"Actually, we...","source_cn":"其实……我们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FCA2663062B3C57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:98:1061001083:0":{"text":"You seem like good people. If you're in trouble, why not just tell us?","source_cn":"两位如果遇到了难题，不妨说出来，我们才能提供帮助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA533E42B6501F41B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:101:1061001084:0":{"text":"Go ahead, Lucy.","source_cn":"露西，告诉他们吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6EA1B2EF030B437","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:102:1061001085:0":{"text":"Well, in that case...","source_cn":"既然如此，那就……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x191C214788DC2FA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:103:1061001086:1":{"text":"Lucy and Natsu confess that they came from another world in search of Aquarius...","source_cn":"露西和纳兹坦承来自异世界，来此寻找阿葵亚……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x498DE5DB0C1B6355","variant_status":"","male":"","femal